1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:08,650
A real request, in Nigerian business English: fifty bags of rice at forty-five thousand, twenty cartons of Indomie at eight thousand.

2
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:10,450
Watch the trace.

3
00:00:10,450 --> 00:00:17,362
Policy runs first — before the model — and flags this as lane two: consequential, needs human review.

4
00:00:17,362 --> 00:00:23,375
Then the actual N-ATLAS call, about three and a half seconds on a rented RTX 3090.

5
00:00:23,375 --> 00:00:27,550
The output isn't prose — it's a validated invoice draft.

6
00:00:27,550 --> 00:00:33,962
Two million four hundred and ten thousand naira — the arithmetic was checked deterministically, not by the model.

7
00:00:33,962 --> 00:00:40,712
And every field carries provenance: what came from the request, what the model inferred, what the system computed.

